Approval Policy

    This policy defines when human approval is
required before a purchase can proceed.

    Purchases up to €5,000 do not require manager
approval.

    Purchases above €5,000 and up to €50,000 require
department-manager approval.

    Purchases above €50,000 require both department-manager
and finance-manager approval.

    Human approval is also required when an unapproved
supplier is selected, when the recommended supplier
does not meet the required delivery deadline, or when
an exception to normal company procurement rules is
required.

    The AI Procurement Agent may determine that approval
is required, but it cannot approve the purchase itself.

    The workflow must pause until an authorized human
approves or rejects the request.

    If the purchase is rejected, the final purchase request
must not be created.
